drylab-onlyoffice: a modified version of ONLYOFFICE Docs Community
==================================================================

This repository builds a MODIFIED VERSION of ONLYOFFICE Docs (Document
Server) Community Edition, the original software developed by Ascensio
System SIA (https://www.onlyoffice.com), (c) Ascensio System SIA 2009-2026.

It is based on the official image onlyoffice/documentserver:10.0.0.1
(package onlyoffice-documentserver 10.0.0-169), built from the upstream
source at these exact revisions:

  ONLYOFFICE/web-apps               v10.0.0.169  493e500c56ec96ccaa0452ab092cbce23b6dcc2e
  ONLYOFFICE/sdkjs                  v10.0.0.169  3679e0375a758d7dc59d31337a45461be3525ed8
  ONLYOFFICE/server                 v10.0.0.169  f9a8df6e7c9aa388c0d525965923c803f4cbc071
  ONLYOFFICE/core                   v10.0.0.169  76af764fcb777291098c73728044249b6893af6a
  ONLYOFFICE/Docker-DocumentServer  v10.0.0.1    d59714446cde55a9f814928d1d984a6f43911bd7

(all at https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/<repository>).

